WEBVTT

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:17.260
We have an unprecedented overtime!
With consent from both dorms,

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.550
the fated showdown between Inuzuka and Persia begins!

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.890
The contest's result depend on these two groups!

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.750
We'll kill you if you lose!

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.980
Lady Persia!

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.270
Though, dragging Persia out here with her injuries...

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:34.760
Who knew Inuzuka was so underhanded?

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.640
I know you're not the type who can't fight
when their wounds are hurting.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:45.020
You got that right. I'll make you regret calling me out.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.330
She's acting strong.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:51.400
There's no way it doesn't hurt just to stand.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.120
-Let's go!
-Come at me!

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:36.760
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:45.610
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.610
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:56.950
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.120
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:05.880
So that I can protect you

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.380
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:16.930
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:21.980
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:28.940
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Romio and Juliet and the Sports Festival

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.680
You wanted to give me a chance to redeem myself.

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:43.350
If you don't fight with all you've got
when the day comes, I'll be angry!

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:47.700
So, I can't afford to lose.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.390
Not to you or anyone else.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:55.230
It's one big back and forth! What an incredible fight!
Neither is giving an inch!

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:07.790
What the heck was that?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.170
You can do it.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:20.930
-You can do it, White Cats girl!
-Give the Black Doggies what for!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.400
Don't lose, Miss Persia!

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.550
You can do this!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.680
One last push! Go for it!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:28.200
We're rooting for you!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.940
Yeah!

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:38.940
These guys switch sides at the drop of a hat.
It looks like you're wearing out.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:42.490
Same for you.
You can't even catch your breath.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.740
Come on, let's...

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.370
Finish this already!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:52.930
I've got you!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.630
Soft

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.150
Soft... and squishy...

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:32.770
Today's MVP is Juliet Persia of the White Cats!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.650
I'm sure you know what this means, Inuzuka.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:44.610
You're no longer the Black Doggy leader.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:47.890
Done in by a boob!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.020
You'll be punished as a war criminal!

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:58.200
Lady Persia! Lady Persia!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:04:59.900
Where are you?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:04.950
There's a jinx that makes the MVP
and their dance partner a couple forever.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.880
If Lady Persia asks me, it could come true!

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.310
Scott!

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.660
Lady Pers--

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.180
"Ugh"? What's that mean?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:16.510
Anyway, you haven't forgotten, have you?

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:17.790
Your punishment.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.310
Punishment?

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.560
Scott! If you lose, you'll be shaved clean!

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.430
And you did lose, no?

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:32.490
Shaving time. Shall we?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:35.560
Saying it like that doesn't make it cute!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.700
No! This is tyranny!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.830
Don't worry, I won't be shaving your head.

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:44.240
Then where? What do you plan to shave?

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.540
Save me! Lady Persia!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:53.540
It's over. All of it.
I'm a
Boob
Loving Fool
