Reflection

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:53.580
I'm a
Boob
Loving Fool
Self
Reflection
It's over. All of it.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:53.880
It's over. All of it.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:56.250
The Black Doggies have hung me out to dry.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:06:00.270
Persia gave me the cold shoulder
and won't even make eye contact.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:04.210
Goodness, what a face you're making.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.470
-Pull yourself together.
-Persia!

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:11.740
I'm sorry for before.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.660
For touching your brea--

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:17.940
You don't need to bring it up!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.490
Wait, what about the after party?

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:21.910
I slipped away.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.280
You're the MVP. Can you do that?

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:29.660
But, the one I want to dance with...

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:35.300
Inuzuka, do you know about the sports festival jinx?

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:38.640
Jinx? What's that?

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:42.020
Never mind. It's nothing.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:45.920
Hey, Romio Inuzuka.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.070
Would you care...

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.110
to dance?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.530
I'm not actually giving you a choice.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.870
We promised we'd have to obey one order from the MVP.

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:05.580
It's not like I'd refuse.
Though, I don't know how they dance in the West.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.820
Then we can do a dance from Touwa.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.200
I've got this bad foot, after all.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:13.950
You sure? Well then...

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:21.620
If the pain subsides, come watch the match.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:27.630
If you don't,
you won't be able to see me mop the floor with this guy.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:33.140
Why don't you just go on and...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.100
die already!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.770
Persia! Get out here!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.080
Yeah, yeah

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.400
Inuzuka...

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.380
Thank you!

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.900
Sure.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.760
I'll definitely return the favor.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:55.160
No matter what happens, I'll protect you.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.660
It's okay. You don't need to thank me.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.810
Touwa's dances are pretty strange.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.850
-I like it!
-Yeah?

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.180
The reason we've assembled today...

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.980
is to discuss this year's sports festival.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:22.660
As you know,
the third-year's victors are the Black Doggies.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.160
Second-years, a draw.

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.240
And first-years, the White Cats.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:30.340
Which makes the final results a draw.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:34.950
The sports festival was a month ago, wasn't it?
Why now, of all times?

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:38.300
I've received information that cannot be ignored.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:42.330
Some trouble occurred on the first day,
during the first-year portion.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.430
Trouble? Was there?

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:49.340
Don't play dumb. Did you really think we wouldn't know?

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:59.110
The one who threw away the Black Doggies' victory
in the rematch was their ultra-problematic child, no?

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:03.750
-What's the point in disputing it now?
-I'm not talking about the results.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:08.910
I'm told the reason for the trouble
was a faction war between White Cat first-years.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.610
I'm sure you're all aware of what I'm referring to.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:18.340
The ringleader, Aby Ssinia, was discovered
to be at fault, and quickly lost popularity.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:21.120
His faction is falling apart.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:25.760
We prefects have a duty
to protect our boarding students.

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.930
Following this,
we will have to enforce stricter dorm surveillance--

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:31.390
We don't need to hear that from the Black Doggies.

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:34.260
Us White Cats are all upstanding.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:41.110
Rather, shouldn't we just strap a collar on that
ultra-problematic child of yours, Romio Inuzuka?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:43.390
While we're at it, we'll put some on you, too!

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:50.500
I should have known bringing this to the table
with you lot would be a fruitless effort.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:54.860
Do you wish to start a war here and now?

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:01.260
What a short temper you have.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:06.390
Representative, you're not furthering the discussion.
Please cease breathing at once.

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.540
Sieber, are you telling me to die?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:12.670
-Look, dissension in the lower ranks.
-Yes.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:17.110
The Black Doggies' "ultra-problematic child," huh?

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.030
Your fever's not going down.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.430
This whole month,
you've been uncharacteristically helpful.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.850
I'll Carry Your Textbooks

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:29.600
This whole month,
you've been uncharacteristically helpful.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.120
I Cleaned The Bathing Area

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:34.020
Who would've guessed
you'd get a fever from all the stress?

00:10:34.020 --> 00:10:36.070
It's surprisingly sensitive of you.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.820
Your towel is slipping.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.580
Goodness.

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.700
You're so hopeless, Inuzuka.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.330
Having a bad dream?

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.430
I'll go get a fresh towel.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.020
Persia...

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:57.530
I'm the one who's hopeless.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:00.490
Inuzuka loves Persia.

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.360
Hasuki was rejected.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:06.850
Holding on to these feelings is meaningless, but...

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.350
Hasuki! A skirmish broke out! Back us up!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:14.860
-But-- Inuzuka is--
-You're our leader, aren't you? Come on!

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:24.840
I haven't had a fever since I was a lad.

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:29.390
When my body gets weak, my heart always follows.

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.680
I want to see Persia.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:37.000
I haven't seen her since the sports festival.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:41.700
-No. I don't want her to see me in this weak state.
-Inuzuka. Inuzuka...

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:45.510
-What? Someone's...
-Inuzuka. Are you okay?

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.580
Persia!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:58.530
Oh, I see. I'm dreaming. Yeah, of course.
There's no way Persia would be here.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.260
You've got a fever?

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:04.300
Hey there, my pretty, pretty, pretty princess.

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.910
Looks like it's pretty bad.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.390
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.310
Could you clean my ears?

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:16.920
Is that necessary? Get it together!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:20.780
Per-Per's soft little hand...

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.970
is touching my cheek...

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.550
She's touching me?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.870
This isn't a dream?

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.860
Of course it's not, dummy.

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:31.870
I snuck in here in disguise.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:35.850
What are you here for, idiot? Go home!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.330
Now you're going to act tough?

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.070
You want me to clean your ears?

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:47.170
Who would want something so childish--?

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.330
Hey! You need to rest!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:53.830
I'll nurse you back to health.
So just sleep peacefully.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.600
No way!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:13:02.090
Char even told you not to sneak into
the Black Doggy House disguised as Julio anymore.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.680
If someone catches you--

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.820
Consider it a thank you.
For the sports festival.

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:11.490
I'll be the one to decide
what appearance I take on.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.810
I won't let Char, you...

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:17.060
or anyone else decide for me.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:21.600
Of course, I'll bear the responsibility
that comes with it on my own.

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:23.450
So don't concern yourself.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:27.570
Persia's so stubborn.
It doesn't matter what I say.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.760
But, I'm so moved that she'd come to nurse me.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:34.580
I've got to get the air circulating first.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:38.080
Your room looks dismal.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.270
I'll tidy it up a bit.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:45.480
After screwing up in the sports festival,
my room became the storage room.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:48.090
Hasuki's even the leader now.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:51.100
I see.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.850
You shouldn't worry.
It all happened because of my decisions.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.350
What are you--?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:00.080
Boob Club Monthly
What's that? Do I own such thing?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:00.650
Boob Club Monthly

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.750
Inuzuka...

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.790
What you've done can never be forgiven.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.050
But...

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:11.380
How could I possibly blame you?

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.300
I mean...

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:16.260
I love boobs too!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.600
Here's a get well present!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:22.000
Once you're well,
you have got to tell me what Persia's felt like!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:25.480
-Keep this a secret from Maru and the others!
-Hold it!

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.690
That's Kohistuji's!

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.140
I see.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:34.140
What's that expression? It's new to Romio!

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.640
You're mistaken! I swear!
That stuff doesn't interest me.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.720
I'd say it's pretty normal for guys your age.

00:14:40.720 --> 00:14:43.270
Miss Persia, please look at me.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:45.120
Seriously, you're mistaken!

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.490
I don't give a damn about other girls' chests!

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:50.660
The only chest I'm interested in is yours! So--

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.530
Wait, what am I saying?

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:56.790
How lewd.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.890
Lewd...

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.380
I don't care anymore.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.900
I'll get you some water and something to eat.

00:15:07.850 --> 00:15:09.550
Which way is the Dining Hall?

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.320
Oh, he's asleep.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:19.140
Now that I think of it,
I've been at this school for over 10 years,

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.940
and the Black Doggy House's interior
is still a mystery to me.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.210
There's a festival coming up that's close to campus.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:28.630
Was that the Harvest Festival?
Is it already that time of year?

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:30.820
I have to avoid people as much as possible.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:34.830
Oh, here's the big hall where the study session was held.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:37.390
They have a stack room, too!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.460
What a spacious balcony.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:42.810
You can gaze down on the campus.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:47.960
Wait, I'm getting sidetracked.
I'm supposed to be nursing Inuzuka!

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.220
Found it! The Dining Hall!

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.570
An apple should cut it for a meal.

00:15:57.070 --> 00:16:00.110
Oh, where am I now?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:05.610
Hey! What business does a middle schooler have
in the high school hall?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.610
Maru! I'm bad with him.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:10.920
Are you here visiting someone?

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:13.780
I'm looking after Inuzuka--

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.510
What was that for?

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:19.620
Stow it. There's no food for that chump here.

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:24.600
I shouldn't retort. I need to get away, now.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:28.100
By the way,
it's supposed to rain this evening.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.850
I see.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.650
I heard the housemaster even slipped a disk.

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:36.260
-So, what year?
-What?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:41.320
I'm asking what year in middle school you are.
Are you deaf?

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:42.770
That's not what you said.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.990
Could he be doubting my identity?

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.530
What does it matter? Out of the way.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:51.040
Well, damn.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.660
Just who the hell are you?

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.400
A boy or a girl?

00:16:57.400 --> 00:17:01.290
A kid or an adult?
You're going nowhere until I know for sure.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.670
Crap. He's seen through me after all!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.710
Hey! Get back here!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.720
Damn it. Why's he running? It was just a question.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.770
I wonder how much he knows.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.480
If Maru finds out about us, we're finished for sure!

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:21.120
I have to find somewhere to hide, it doesn't matter where!

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.230
What's this room for?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.230
Steam?

00:17:36.130 --> 00:17:37.880
What? Is this a bath?

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:40.970
-Hey-- Hey, is that...?
-I think it is.

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.550
I'll go check.

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:48.140
It is, it's a boy!

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.640
-Wait!
-Call a teacher!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:50.840
I'm--!

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.210
-He took off!
-Someone catch him!
Girls' Bath

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.110
-He took off!
-Someone catch him!

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:59.190
Persia was gone before I realized it.

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.350
Was she so angry at me she left?

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:04.120
Inuzuka...

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.760
-Persi--
-Inuzuka!

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:10.480
-Black Doggy House is scary!
-What happened?

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:15.170
-You'd better not look over here.
-I won't.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.660
How did this situation arise?

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.880
Am I going to die? I've got to calm down.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:25.350
Persia has placed her trust in me!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:28.260
Behind me, Persia is...

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:30.140
Right now, in my room...

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:33.130
No, no! What am I thinking?

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.270
I can't look, I can't look, I can't look!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.140
My eyes! Stop, my eyes!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.400
-You lecher.
-I'm sorry. Please don't be mad.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.250
I don't know what you mean.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:55.960
Jeez, your clothes are so big!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:59.530
It's not my fault!
You're the one who got your clothes wet!

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.460
It's locked.

00:19:04.460 --> 00:19:06.410
Hey, Inuzuka! Are you there?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.260
Inuzuka!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.810
Inuzuka, I'm here for my ero-mag!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.550
No response. Is he sleeping?

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:19.000
Dang it! I always get the urge to read them
after I've lent them out.

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.300
Guess I'll come back later.

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:28.060
I'm sorry. I did this without thinking.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:30.790
I forgot the door was locked.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.120
So...

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:35.820
Please don't think I'm an immodest girl!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:41.880
You're fever's getting worse! Hang in there!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:50.640
It's like that time I was on the verge of death...

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:52.680
having a nightmare.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:58.900
Hush little baby, don't say a word

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:03.940
Mama's gonna buy you a mockin' bird

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:09.450
And if that mockin' bird won't sing

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:14.810
Mama's gonna buy you a diamond ring

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:14.920
And if that diamond turns brass
Mama's gonna buy you a diamond ring

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:15.090
And if that diamond turns brass

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:20.590
And if that diamond ring is brass...
And if that diamond turns brass

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:20.650
And if that diamond turns brass

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:20.760
Mama's gonna buy you a looking glass

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:25.180
Mama's gonna buy you a lookin' glass
Mama's gonna buy you a looking glass

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:25.590
Mama's gonna buy you a looking glass

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.920
Oh, did I wake you up?

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:30.750
You were having a nightmare. Sorry.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.670
It's fine. But where did you hear that song?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:37.520
It's a lullaby that's been around in the West a long time.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:42.680
It helps you sleep. My father would often sing it
when I couldn't fall asleep.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.200
Your complexion looks a lot better.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:49.490
It seems like my fever's gone.

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:52.370
Really? You still have one.

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.190
This fever is not from being sick.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.120
It is gone.

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:00.730
Well, a good part of the fever was mental.

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:03.200
Maybe it went away because I was able to relax.

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.920
If that's the case, it's thanks to you.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:09.950
Really? That seems pretty simplistic.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:13.780
Thank you. For coming all the way here to nurse me.

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:16.390
Even if you're just returning a favor, I'm really happy.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.390
But we don't know who might come knocking next.

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.970
Staying here any longer is dangerous. So...

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:26.700
It's not like I came here with the intent to nurse you.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:29.720
I didn't even know you had a fever.

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.040
Then why did you come here?

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.620
Why? It's not really...

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.410
-You're making me curious.
-It's nothing!

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:40.930
Why are you offended? Just tell me.

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:43.490
You be quiet! I just...

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:49.160
came because I thought I'd like to see you.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.870
There's no reason.

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:53.370
Is there a problem?

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:01.130
The fever's back! Keep it together!

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:08.390
Big sis, what are you looking at?

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.640
Our problematic child in question.

00:22:11.650 --> 00:22:13.640
Are you interested?

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:18.400
Well, as a prefect, I've got to keep my eye on him.

00:22:41.770 --> 00:22:48.610
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:56.620
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:03.920
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:10.550
I want to match the love you have for me

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:18.770
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:18.930 --> 00:23:25.110
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:32.360
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:34.570
I want to support you

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:42.410
With everything I have

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:50.510
Until the world can one day change

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:02.170
Rubby, rub

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:03.540
You brats! Enough with the perverted interjections!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:04.640
Romio and the Prefect
You brats! Enough with the perverted interjections!

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.880
Next time, "Romio and the Prefect."
Romio and the Prefect
